.\" Manpage for myfreerman.

.TH man 1 "my-mirror man page"

.SH NAME

my-mirror \- create mysql database replicas

.SH INSTALLATION

This is part os my-admin-tools package.

.SH ENVIRONMENT

MY_MIRROR_DEFER_INDEXES:

	If this variable is 1 in AWS RDS mode:

		- When copying table structures, indexes and constraints are ignored.

		- After copying table data, indexes and constraints are created.
